'about':()=>openDialog('A glimpse of Eleva.',`<div class="eyebrow">PRIVATE INTERACTIVE PROTOTYPE</div><h3>Your wealth. Your credit.</h3><p class="lead">Explore a premium card experience built around independent professionals and wealth-backed spending power.</p><ul><li>Convert reward points into simulated investments with one click after setup.</li><li>Discover, save, and activate illustrative member benefits.</li><li>Freeze your demo card, change controls, and set a personal transaction cap.</li><li>Pay a simulated bill and see available credit return.</li><li>Pledge or release demo investments and see limits change.</li></ul><div class="callout">${icon('info',18)}All balances, portfolios, card details, and merchant terms are fictional. Changes are stored in this browser. This is not a banking service and no real transactions are submitted. Photography is illustrative; locations and products shown are not confirmed merchant offerings.</div>`,`<button class="primary-button" data-action="close">Explore Eleva</button>`),
